OL,3,GNEWSANo more cereal at the end of the
OL,4,Aaisle? New rules in Scotland's
OL,5,Asupermarkets
OL,6,
OL,7,FSugary soft drinks, biscuits and some
OL,8,Fbreakfast cereals have disappeared from
OL,9,Fprominent positions in Scotland's
OL,10,Fsupermarkets.
OL,12,FThe Scottish government has introduced
OL,13,Frules meaning some products that are
OL,14,Fhigh in fat, sugar and salt can no
OL,15,Flonger be put in prime end-of-aisle
OL,16,Fslots, or feature as part of multi-buy
OL,17,Foffers in store or online.
OL,19,FThe regulations will apply to the usual
OL,20,Fsuspects - chocolate, crisps, biscuits
OL,21,Fand ice cream.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,426,420,260,160,0,100
