OL,3,GNEWSANo more cereal at the end of the
OL,4,Aaisle? New rules in Scotland's
OL,5,Asupermarkets
OL,6,
OL,7,FBut it could also include kombucha,
OL,8,Fseaweed snacks, muesli and chewing gum,
OL,9,Fdepending on their sugar content.
